,\n527|\t\tProjectionPlanID:            planID,\n528|\t\tProjectedObjectManifestID:   projectedID,\n529|\t\tExpectedTargetNativeSession: expected,\n530|\t\tObservedTargetNativeSession: observed,\n531|\t\tObservedEnvironment:         observedTuple,\n532|\t\tParsedEventCount:            parsedCount,\n533|\t\tParsedHeadIDs:               heads,\n534|\t\tWorkspaceBinding:            binding,\n535|\t\tStructuralDigest:            structural,\n536|\t\tEvidenceObjects:             rows,\n537|\t}), nil\n538|}","final_result":true}}}
