{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ec75","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d595-9c87-7b41-8174-a6b1261d78d7"},"sequence":5269,"recorded_at":1780531400010533,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"3f52b624-2d68-419d-80a5-f0df2f588e41","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"3f52b624-2d68-419d-80a5-f0df2f588e41","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"3f52b624-2d68-419d-80a5-f0df2f588e41"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Handed off to review: TASK-260830-1esv6u (implement-validation-report-and-reconciliation) is now `to-review`, candidate left uncommitted on the Story branch at `f416d54`.\n\n## What was built\n\nNew package `internal/clonereconcile` proving SPEC v0.7.0 §13.14.2 reconciliation completeness, with two production entries in [reconcile.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-21bxa3/worktree/internal/clonereconcile/reconcile.go):\n\n- `ReadBackHistory` — decodes staged/live history solely through `clonereadback.DecodeReadBackEvidenceManifest`, seals only in staged/live order.\n- `Reconcile` — tier-1/tier-2 link census, tier-3 census over owner-decoded fidelity rows, plan/projected/tuple/native pairing against the sealed reads, then derives both reports through `clonefidelity`/`cloneplan`/`clonereadback`, with the valid bit decided by the owner (true-then-false seal). 60 refusal sites, 59 distinct literals.\n\nTests: 3,528-cell generated property against an independent oracle ([property_test.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-21bxa3/worktree/internal/clonereconcile/property_test.go)), 65-row exact-literal gate table, entry/owner-reachability census + no-reimplementation guard (control-planted), skip census (empty allowlist), mechanical refusal-site→matrix census. Mutant harness: 58 narrowings killed alone, 4 token-preserving attacks killed alone and under the full suite,